WEBVTT

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:02.884
That is the final, and I think
most beautiful lesson,

00:17:02.908 --> 00:17:04.243
of Howard Moskowitz:

00:17:04.267 --> 00:17:07.976
that in embracing the diversity
of human beings,

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.365
we will find a surer way
to true happiness.

00:17:10.769 --> 00:17:11.786
Thank you.

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:12.976
(Applause)